[I] A meson-compatible build system

[T] muon is an implementation of the meson build system in C99 with minimal
[T] dependencies. Besides building projects it offers muon analyze, a static
[T] analyzer and language server for meson.build files, and muon fmt for
[T] formatting them.

[U] https://muon.build

[A] Muon Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

